        <activityName xml:lang="en">Maintenance, transoceanic freight ship</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Maintenance, transoceanic freight ship
The ship is painted 6 times in its entire life span (25 yrs). The consumption of lubricates is included in the fuel consumption for vessel operation.;
UUID: 17e93a2c-9e6c-3120-9947-be8326c5bc48
This inventory includes the use of paint and emissions of the solvent of the paint as NMVOC. Consumption of lubricates are excluded.
Location: Europe
Technology: unknown
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature studies and own assumptions 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_17e93a2c-9e6c-3120-9947-be8326c5bc48.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
